Adapted source:
- serving/lib/search.ts: cosine similarity, maximum score per document, threshold and top-K.
- serving/scripts/build-guides.ts: Markdown heading chunks, metadata chunk, embedding text structure.
- serving/lib/transformers-embedder.ts: feature-extraction, mean pooling and normalization.

Modifications: JavaScript modules, generic documents/configuration, incremental chunk cache,
token windows, atomic snapshots, input validation, polling watcher, skill export and tests.
Transformers.js is used for both indexing and querying instead of Google's separate TFJS runtime.
Google's guides, telemetry, web-feature expansion and evaluation infrastructure are not included.
